    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d573">

                <pb facs="0742" n="456" sameAs="frus:frus1916Supp/pg456"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 611.419/938</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in Great Britain</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Page</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-10-13">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 13, 1916</hi>
                        </date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>3936. Department’s 3945, July 26.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d573-f1"/> Merck and
                    Company report that drugs specified are badly needed. Make endeavor to hasten
                    consideration, if license not definitely refused. Firm says they have heard it
                    stated that shipments to other firms have been licensed.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
